'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Crops|Fruit Tree]] seed that takes 28 days to grow into a [[Persimmon Tree]], after which it will produce one [[Persimmon]] each day during {{Season|Fall}}. Like all Fruit Trees, it will produce year round if planted in the [[Stardew:Greenhouse|Greenhouse]] or on [[Stardew:Ginger Island|Ginger Island]].

Saplings can be purchased from [[Stardew:Pierre's General Store|Pierre's General Store]], [[JojaMart]], and may randomly appear for sale in at the [[Stardew:Traveling Cart|Traveling Cart]]. They can also be obtained by chopping down existing Persimmon Trees.

